### Negative-findings notes

- Verified status chain (all fetched 2026-10-10): xAI's January 2026 funding
  announcement (existence + training only); geotoolbox.ai Grok 5 tracker
  (updated 2026-09-29 — "still in training," no model card, no benchmark);
  zbuild.io Grok 5 guide (2026-03-27 — zero public benchmarks, missed Q1
  target, Polymarket ~33% for a June-2026 ship that then failed); xAI's own
  model docs list no `grok-5` entry; Polymarket repriced a launch by
  2026-12-31 at roughly a coin flip in September 2026.
- Musk's AGI framing ("10% and rising," Oct 2025; "That will be Grok 5,"
  2026-09-14) is a self-stated prediction, not a measurement — no definition,
  no benchmark, no date.
- Every spec in circulation (6T–10T params, 1.5M context, "Reality Engine,"
  native multimodality) is rumor, estimate, or blog coinage; no official
  source confirms any of them.
- With zero verified benchmark numbers, scoring is impossible without
  fabrication, so this report is self-excluded. When Grok 5 ships and xAI (or
  an independent harness) publishes real numbers, a new signed file should
  supersede these notes.

